HPL1 Fledged
============

The engine itself is GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE. Sources carrying the
2006-2010 Frictional Games header come from the HPL1 engine release, the rest
are later additions in HPL1 Rehatched (zenmumbler) and in this fork.

It bundles the following third-party sources, each under its own permissive and
GPL-compatible licence, built from source under dependencies/sources:

Newton Dynamics 2.36 - zlib licence
  http://newtondynamics.com/              dependencies/sources/Newton/LICENSE.md

AngelScript - zlib licence
  https://www.angelcode.com/              dependencies/sources/AngelScript/LICENSE.md

Dear ImGui - MIT licence
  https://github.com/ocornut/imgui        dependencies/sources/imgui/LICENSE.txt

cgltf - MIT licence
  https://github.com/jkuhlmann/cgltf      dependencies/sources/cgltf/LICENSE

tinyXML - zlib/libpng licence
  http://www.grinninglizard.com/tinyxml/

stb_image, stb_vorbis - public domain (or MIT, at your option)
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

SDL2 and OpenAL are linked as system libraries and are not redistributed here.

No game data is included. Penumbra: Overture's assets remain the property of
Frictional Games.
